{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50837","headline":"览卷赠张山人 · 赵嘏","name":"览卷赠张山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五字谁能摘？一枝犹未攀。\n始知无价玉，出自有名山。\n春静烟花秀，夜深风月闲。\n如何恃高节，垂老住云间。\n（见《永乐大典》卷三○○四「九真」「人」字〖五函四十一册〗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50837.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50837","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}